  m_text: 'Clicker Genesis is a Bible-verse idle clicker.


    Tap to earn Ink.
    Spend it to unlock the next verse of scripture, word for word, unedited. Grow
    your scribes, level up, and work your way through the Old Testament, one verse
    at a time.


    Every verse you unlock stays yours - the goal is to learn and
    remember, not just to click.'
